{"id": "qmath1-001", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = √(3-x) + ln(x-1) 的定义域是：\nA. [1,3]\nB. (1,3]\nC. (1,3)\nD. [1,3)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.func"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-002", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x+1) = x^2 + 2x，则 f(x) =\nA. x^2 - 1\nB. x^2 + 1\nC. x^2\nD. x^2 - 2", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.func"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-003", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→0) sin(3x)/x =\nA. 1\nB. 1/3\nC. 0\nD. 3", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.limit"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-004", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→∞) (1 + 2/x)^x =\nA. e\nB. 2e\nC. e^2\nD. e^(1/2)", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.limit"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-005", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→0) (e^x - 1 - x)/x^2 =\nA. 1/2\nB. 1\nC. 0\nD. ∞", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.limit"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-006", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1) 的间断点 x = 1 是：\nA. 跳跃间断点\nB. 无穷间断点\nC. 可去间断点\nD. 振荡间断点", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.cont"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-007", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = e^(1/x) 在 x = 0 处：\nA. 连续\nB. 是第二类间断点（无穷型）\nC. 是可去间断点\nD. 是跳跃间断点", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.cont"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-008", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) = x^3，则 lim(h→0) [f(1+h) - f(1)]/h =\nA. 1\nB. 2\nC. 6\nD. 3", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.deriv"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-009", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) 在 x = 0 处连续，且 lim(x→0) [f(x) - 2x]/x = 1，则 f'(0) =\nA. 3\nB. 2\nC. 1\nD. 不存在", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.deriv", "math.calc.limit"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-010", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) = x^2·e^x，则 f'(x) =\nA. 2x·e^x\nB. (x^2 + 2x)·e^x\nC. x^2·e^x\nD. (2x - x^2)·e^x", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.deriv.rules"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-011", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) = ln(1 + x^2)，则 f''(1) =\nA. 1\nB. 1/2\nC. 0\nD. 2", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.deriv.rules"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-012", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) = ln(2 + x)，则 f^(n)(0)（n ≥ 1）=\nA. (-1)^(n-1)·(n-1)!/2^n\nB. (-1)^n·n!/2^n\nC. (-1)^(n-1)·n!/2^(n+1)\nD. (-1)^(n-1)·(n-1)!/2^(n-1)", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.deriv.rules"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-013", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = x^3 - 3x 在区间 [0, √3] 上满足罗尔定理的条件，则定理结论中的 ξ =\nA. -1\nB. 0\nC. √3\nD. 1", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.mean.thm"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-014", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = x^2 在区间 [0, 1] 上满足拉格朗日中值定理，则定理结论中的 ξ =\nA. 1\nB. 1/2\nC. 1/3\nD. 2/3", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.mean.thm"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-015", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) 在 [0, 1] 上连续，在 (0, 1) 内可导，且 f(1) = 0。为证明存在 ξ∈(0, 1) 使得 ξf'(ξ) + f(ξ) = 0，应构造的辅助函数是：\nA. F(x) = f(x)/x\nB. F(x) = x^2·f(x)\nC. F(x) = x·f(x)\nD. F(x) = e^x·f(x)", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.mean.thm"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-016", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→0) (tan x - sin x)/x^3 =\nA. 1\nB. 0\nC. 2\nD. 1/2", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.lhopital"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-017", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→+∞) x·ln(1 + 1/x) =\nA. 1\nB. 0\nC. e\nD. +∞", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.lhopital"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-018", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→0) [1/x - 1/(e^x - 1)] =\nA. 0\nB. -1/2\nC. 1/2\nD. 1", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.lhopital"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-019", "subject": "math1", "stem": "e^x 的麦克劳林展开式中 x^3 项的系数是：\nA. 1/3\nB. 1/6\nC. 1/24\nD. 1/2", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.taylor"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-020", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(x→0) (cos x - 1 + x^2/2)/x^4 =\nA. 1/12\nB. 1/6\nC. 1/4\nD. 1/24", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.taylor"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-021", "subject": "math1", "stem": "ln(1+x) 带拉格朗日余项的 n 阶麦克劳林公式中，余项 Rn(x) =（其中 0 < ξ < x）\nA. (-1)^n·x^(n+1)/[(n+1)(1+ξ)^(n+1)]\nB. (-1)^(n-1)·x^(n+1)/[(n+1)(1+ξ)^(n+1)]\nC. x^(n+1)/[(n+1)(1+ξ)^(n+1)]\nD. (-1)^n·x^n/[(n+1)(1+ξ)^n]", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.taylor"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-022", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = x^3 - 3x 的单调增加区间是：\nA. (-1, 1)\nB. (-∞, -1) 和 (1, +∞)\nC. (-∞, 0)\nD. (0, +∞)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.mono"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-023", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = x·e^(-x) 的极大值是：\nA. e\nB. -1/e\nC. 2/e\nD. 1/e", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.mono"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-024", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f'(x) > 0 对一切实数 x 成立，则方程 f(x) = 0 的实根个数至多为：\nA. 0 个\nB. 2 个\nC. 1 个\nD. 无穷多个", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.mono"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-025", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = x^3 的拐点是：\nA. 无拐点\nB. (0, 0)\nC. (1, 1)\nD. (0, 1)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.convex"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-026", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = e^(-x^2) 的拐点个数为：\nA. 0 个\nB. 2 个\nC. 1 个\nD. 3 个", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.convex"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-027", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = x^2/(2x+1) 的渐近线情况是：\nA. 有铅直渐近线 x = -1/2 和斜渐近线 y = x/2 - 1/4\nB. 有铅直渐近线 x = -1/2 和水平渐近线 y = 1/2\nC. 仅有铅直渐近线 x = -1/2\nD. 无渐近线", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.asym"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-028", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = e^(1/x) 的渐近线是：\nA. 仅有水平渐近线 y = 1\nB. 仅有铅直渐近线 x = 0\nC. 斜渐近线 y = x + 1\nD. 有铅直渐近线 x = 0 和水平渐近线 y = 1", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.asym"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-029", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 y = y(x) 由方程 x^2 + y^2 = 1（y > 0）确定，则 dy/dx 在 x = 1/2 处的值为：\nA. -√3\nB. √3/3\nC. -√3/3\nD. -1/2", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.implicit"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-030", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设曲线的参数方程为 x = ln(1 + t^2)，y = t - arctan t，则 dy/dx =\nA. t/2\nB. 2/t\nC. t/4\nD. t", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.implicit"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-031", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ tan x dx =\nA. ln|cos x| + C\nB. ln|sin x| + C\nC. -ln|cos x| + C\nD. -ln|sin x| + C", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.indef"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-032", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ cos(2x)/(sin^2 x·cos^2 x) dx =\nA. cot x + tan x + C\nB. -cot x - tan x + C\nC. -cot x + tan x + C\nD. tan x - cot x + C", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.indef"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-033", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ (ln x)/x dx =\nA. (ln x)^2 + C\nB. 1/x^2 + C\nC. x·ln x - x + C\nD. (ln x)^2/2 + C", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.indef"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-034", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ x/(1 + x^4) dx =\nA. (1/2)·arctan(x^2) + C\nB. arctan(x^2) + C\nC. (1/4)·arctan(x^2) + C\nD. (1/2)·arctan x + C", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.sub"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-035", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫₀¹ dx/(1 + √x) =\nA. 2 - ln 2\nB. 2 - 2ln 2\nC. 1 - 2ln 2\nD. 2ln 2 - 2", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.sub"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-036", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ x·cos x dx =\nA. x·sin x - cos x + C\nB. -x·sin x + cos x + C\nC. x·sin x + cos x + C\nD. x·sin x + C", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.parts"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-037", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫₀¹ x·e^x dx =\nA. 1\nB. e - 1\nC. e\nD. e + 1", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.parts", "math.calc.int.def"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-038", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ dx/(x^2 - 1) =\nA. (1/2)·ln|(x+1)/(x-1)| + C\nB. ln|x^2 - 1| + C\nC. (1/2)·arctan x + C\nD. (1/2)·ln|(x-1)/(x+1)| + C", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.rational"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-039", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫ dx/[(x+1)(x+2)] =\nA. ln|(x+2)/(x+1)| + C\nB. ln|(x+1)/(x+2)| + C\nC. ln|(x+1)(x+2)| + C\nD. (1/2)·ln|(x+1)/(x+2)| + C", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.rational"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-040", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∫₋π^π x^3·cos x dx =\nA. π\nB. 2π\nC. 0\nD. π^2", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.def"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-041", "subject": "math1", "stem": "lim(n→∞) (1^2 + 2^2 + … + n^2)/n^3 =\nA. 1/2\nB. 1\nC. 2/3\nD. 1/3", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.def"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-042", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 F(x) = ∫₀^(x^2) sin(t^2) dt，则 F'(x) =\nA. 2x·sin(x^4)\nB. sin(x^4)\nC. 2x·sin(x^2)\nD. sin(x^2)", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.def", "math.calc.deriv.rules"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-043", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = x^2 与直线 y = x 所围成平面图形的面积为：\nA. 1/3\nB. 1/2\nC. 1/6\nD. 1", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.app"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-044", "subject": "math1", "stem": "由曲线 y = √x（0 ≤ x ≤ 1）与 x 轴围成的图形绕 x 轴旋转一周所得旋转体的体积为：\nA. π\nB. π/2\nC. π/4\nD. 2π", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.app"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-045", "subject": "math1", "stem": "极坐标曲线 r = 1 + cosθ 所围成图形的面积为：\nA. π\nB. 2π\nC. 3π/4\nD. 3π/2", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.app"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-046", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = x^2 在点 (1, 1) 处的曲率为：\nA. √2/2\nB. 2\nC. 1/2\nD. √2", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.curvature"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-047", "subject": "math1", "stem": "曲线 y = (2/3)·x^(3/2) 上相应于 x 从 0 到 3 的一段弧的长度为：\nA. 16/3\nB. 14/3\nC. 14\nD. 7/3", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.curvature"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-048", "subject": "math1", "stem": "反常积分 ∫₁^∞ dx/x^2 =\nA. 发散\nB. 1/2\nC. 2\nD. 1", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.imp"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-049", "subject": "math1", "stem": "反常积分 ∫₋∞^(+∞) dx/(1 + x^2) =\nA. 2π\nB. π/2\nC. π\nD. 发散", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.imp"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-050", "subject": "math1", "stem": "反常积分 ∫₀¹ ln x dx =\nA. 0\nB. -1\nC. 发散\nD. 1", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.imp"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-051", "subject": "math1", "stem": "微分方程 y'' + 4y = 0 的通解为：\nA. y = (C₁ + C₂x)·e^(2x)\nB. y = C₁·cos 2x + C₂·sin 2x\nC. y = C₁·e^(2x) + C₂·e^(-2x)\nD. y = C₁·cos 4x + C₂·sin 4x", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.ode"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-052", "subject": "math1", "stem": "微分方程 y' + 2y = e^(-x) 的通解为：\nA. y = e^(-x) + C·e^(-2x)\nB. y = e^x + C·e^(-2x)\nC. y = C·e^(-2x)\nD. y = e^(-x) + C·e^(2x)", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.ode"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-053", "subject": "math1", "stem": "微分方程 y'' + y = sin x 的特解形式应设为（A、B 为待定常数）：\nA. y* = A·cos x + B·sin x\nB. y* = x^2·(A·cos x + B·sin x)\nC. y* = A·e^x·sin x\nD. y* = x·(A·cos x + B·sin x)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.ode"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-054", "subject": "math1", "stem": "级数 Σ_{n=1}^∞ (-1)^(n-1)/√n 的敛散性为：\nA. 绝对收敛\nB. 发散\nC. 条件收敛\nD. 敛散性无法判定", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.nums"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-055", "subject": "math1", "stem": "级数 Σ_{n=1}^∞ n!/n^n 的敛散性为：\nA. 收敛\nB. 发散\nC. 条件收敛\nD. 无法判定", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.nums"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-056", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设正项级数 Σ aₙ 收敛，则下列级数中必收敛的是：\nA. Σ √aₙ\nB. Σ 1/(1 + aₙ)\nC. Σ aₙ²\nD. Σ (aₙ + 1)/n", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.nums"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-057", "subject": "math1", "stem": "幂级数 Σ_{n=1}^∞ n·x^n 的收敛域为：\nA. [-1, 1]\nB. (-1, 1)\nC. [-1, 1)\nD. (-1, 1]", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.pow"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-058", "subject": "math1", "stem": "幂级数 Σ_{n=1}^∞ (x-1)^n/n^2 的收敛域为：\nA. (0, 2)\nB. [0, 2)\nC. (0, 2]\nD. [0, 2]", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.pow"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-059", "subject": "math1", "stem": "幂级数 Σ_{n=1}^∞ x^n/n 在 |x| < 1 内的和函数为：\nA. -ln(1 - x)\nB. ln(1 - x)\nC. -ln(1 + x)\nD. ln(1 + x)", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.pow"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-060", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x) = 1/(2 - x) 展开为 x 的幂级数是：\nA. Σ_{n=0}^∞ x^n/2^n（|x| < 2）\nB. Σ_{n=0}^∞ x^n/2^(n+1)（|x| < 2）\nC. Σ_{n=0}^∞ x^n/2^(n+1)（|x| < 1）\nD. Σ_{n=0}^∞ (-1)^n·x^n/2^(n+1)（|x| < 2）", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.expand"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-061", "subject": "math1", "stem": "f(x) = arctan x 的幂级数展开式为：\nA. Σ_{n=0}^∞ (-1)^n·x^(2n+1)/(2n+1)（仅当 |x| < 1 收敛）\nB. Σ_{n=0}^∞ (-1)^n·x^(2n)/(2n)（|x| < 1）\nC. Σ_{n=0}^∞ (-1)^n·x^(2n+1)/(2n+1)（|x| ≤ 1）\nD. Σ_{n=0}^∞ x^(2n+1)/(2n+1)（|x| < 1）", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.expand"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-062", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) = x^2（-π ≤ x ≤ π）被周期延拓为以 2π 为周期的函数，其傅里叶级数在 x = π 处收敛于：\nA. π^2\nB. 0\nC. π^2/2\nD. 2π^2", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.fourier"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-063", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 f(x) = x（-π < x < π），其傅里叶级数的系数 bₙ =\nA. 2·(-1)^n/n\nB. (-1)^(n+1)/n\nC. 2/n\nD. 2·(-1)^(n+1)/n", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.series.fourier"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-064", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 z = x^y（x > 0），则 ∂z/∂x =\nA. x^y·ln x\nB. y·x^(y-1)\nC. x^y/y\nD. y·x^y·ln x", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.multivar.partial"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-065", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 z = f(xy, x/y)，其中 f 具有一阶连续偏导数，则 ∂z/∂x =\nA. x·f₁' - (1/y^2)·f₂'\nB. y·f₁' - (1/y)·f₂'\nC. y·f₁' + (1/y)·f₂'\nD. f₁' + f₂'", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.multivar.partial"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-066", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 z = ln(x^2 + y^2)，则 ∂²z/∂x∂y =\nA. 4xy/(x^2 + y^2)^2\nB. 2/(x^2 + y^2)\nC. -2xy/(x^2 + y^2)^2\nD. -4xy/(x^2 + y^2)^2", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.multivar.partial"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-067", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 - xy + x + y 的极小值为：\nA. -1\nB. 0\nC. 1\nD. -2", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.multivar.extrema"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-068", "subject": "math1", "stem": "在约束条件 x + y = 1 下，函数 z = xy 的最大值为：\nA. 1/2\nB. 1\nC. 1/4\nD. 1/8", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.multivar.extrema"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-069", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 u = x^2 + y^2 + z^2 在点 (1, 1, 1) 处沿方向 l = (1, 1, 1) 的方向导数为：\nA. √3\nB. 2√3\nC. 6\nD. 2", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.dirderiv"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-070", "subject": "math1", "stem": "函数 u = ln(x^2 + y^2 + z^2) 在点 (1, 1, 1) 处方向导数取得最大值的方向是：\nA. (1, -1, 0)\nB. (1, 0, -1)\nC. (0, 0, 1)\nD. (1, 1, 1)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.dirderiv"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-071", "subject": "math1", "stem": "∬_D (x^2 + y^2) dσ，其中 D = {(x, y) | x^2 + y^2 ≤ 1}，则该二重积分的值为：\nA. π/2\nB. π\nC. π/4\nD. 2π/3", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.double"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-072", "subject": "math1", "stem": "二次积分 ∫₀¹ dx ∫ₓ¹ e^(-y^2) dy 的值为：\nA. 1 - 1/e\nB. (1/2)·(1 - 1/e)\nC. (1/2)·(1 + 1/e)\nD. 1/e", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.double"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-073", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 D 由直线 y = x、y = 0、x = 1 围成，则 ∬_D xy dσ =\nA. 1/4\nB. 1/2\nC. 1/16\nD. 1/8", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.double"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-074", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 L 为圆周 x^2 + y^2 = 1，则第一类曲线积分 ∮_L (x^2 + y^2) ds =\nA. π\nB. 4π\nC. 2π\nD. 1", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.curve"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-075", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 L 为圆周 x^2 + y^2 = 1，取逆时针方向，则第二类曲线积分 ∮_L x dy - y dx =\nA. π\nB. 2π\nC. 0\nD. -2π", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.calc.int.curve", "math.calc.int.double"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-076", "subject": "math1", "stem": "已知向量 a = (1, 2, 2)，b = (2, -1, 2)，则 a 与 b 夹角的余弦为：\nA. 2/3\nB. 4/9\nC. 1/3\nD. 4/3", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.vector"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-077", "subject": "math1", "stem": "向量组 α₁ = (1, 2, 3)，α₂ = (2, 4, 6)，α₃ = (3, 6, 9) 的秩为：\nA. 1\nB. 2\nC. 3\nD. 0", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.vector", "math.linalg.rank"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-078", "subject": "math1", "stem": "下列向量中与 a = (1, 1, 1) 正交的单位向量是：\nA. (√2/2)·(1, 1, 0)\nB. (1, -1, 0)\nC. (√3/3)·(1, 1, 1)\nD. (√2/2)·(1, -1, 0)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.vector"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-079", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设矩阵 A 的两行依次为 (1, 2)、(2, 1)，则 A^2 =\nA. [[3, 4], [4, 3]]\nB. [[5, 2], [2, 5]]\nC. [[5, 4], [4, 5]]\nD. [[1, 4], [4, 1]]", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.matrix"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-080", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A、B 为同阶方阵，则 (AB)^T =\nA. B^T·A^T\nB. A^T·B^T\nC. AB\nD. BA", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.matrix"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-081", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 3 阶矩阵，|A| = 2，则 |2A| =\nA. 8\nB. 4\nC. 16\nD. 6", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.matrix", "math.linalg.det"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-082", "subject": "math1", "stem": "行列式 D 的三行依次为 (0, 1, 0)、(1, 0, 0)、(0, 0, 1)，则 D =\nA. 1\nB. -1\nC. 0\nD. 2", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.det"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-083", "subject": "math1", "stem": "行列式 D 的三行依次为 (1, 1, 1)、(1, 2, 3)、(1, 4, 9)，则 D =\nA. 1\nB. 6\nC. 12\nD. 2", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.det"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-084", "subject": "math1", "stem": "上三角行列式 D 的三行依次为 (1, 2, 3)、(0, 4, 5)、(0, 0, 6)，则 D =\nA. 24\nB. 6\nC. 48\nD. -24", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.det.props", "math.linalg.det"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-085", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 3 阶矩阵且 |A| = 3，则 |-A| =\nA. 3\nB. -3\nC. 27\nD. -27", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.det.props"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-086", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设矩阵 A 的两行依次为 (1, 2)、(2, 5)，则 A^(-1) =\nA. [[5, 2], [2, 1]]\nB. [[-5, 2], [2, -1]]\nC. [[5, -2], [-2, 1]]\nD. [[1, -2], [-2, 5]]", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.inverse"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-087", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A、B 均为 n 阶可逆矩阵，则 (AB)^(-1) =\nA. B^(-1)·A^(-1)\nB. A^(-1)·B^(-1)\nC. AB\nD. A^(-1)·B", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.inverse"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-088", "subject": "math1", "stem": "矩阵 M 的三行依次为 (1, 2, 3)、(2, 4, 6)、(1, 1, 1)，则 M 的秩为：\nA. 1\nB. 3\nC. 0\nD. 2", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.rank"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-089", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 4×3 矩阵且 r(A) = 3，则齐次线性方程组 Ax = 0：\nA. 有无穷多非零解\nB. 仅有零解\nC. 有 2 个线性无关的解\nD. 无解", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.rank", "math.linalg.linear.sys"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-090", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 n 阶矩阵（n ≥ 2）且 r(A) = n - 1，则伴随矩阵 A* 的秩 r(A*) =\nA. 0\nB. n - 1\nC. 1\nD. n", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.rank"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-091", "subject": "math1", "stem": "线性方程组 {x + y + z = 6；2x - y + z = 3；x + 2y - z = 2} 的解为：\nA. (2, 1, 3)\nB. (1, 3, 2)\nC. (3, 2, 1)\nD. (1, 2, 3)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.linear.sys"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-092", "subject": "math1", "stem": "齐次线性方程组 {x + 2y = 0；2x + 4y = 0} 的基础解系可取为：\nA. (-2, 1)^T\nB. (2, 1)^T\nC. (1, 1)^T\nD. (1, 0)^T", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.linear.sys"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-093", "subject": "math1", "stem": "当 λ 满足什么条件时，线性方程组 {x + 2y = 1；2x + 4y = λ} 无解：\nA. λ = 2\nB. λ = 0\nC. λ ≠ 2\nD. 对任意 λ 都无解", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.linear.sys"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-094", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 5×4 矩阵且 r(A) = 3，则 Ax = 0 的基础解系中含有的解向量个数为：\nA. 2\nB. 1\nC. 3\nD. 4", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.solve.struct"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-095", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 m×n 矩阵，η₁、η₂ 是非齐次方程组 Ax = b（b ≠ 0）的两个解，ξ 是对应齐次方程组 Ax = 0 的解，则下列向量中必是 Ax = b 的解的是：\nA. ξ - η₁\nB. η₁ + η₂\nC. η₁ - η₂\nD. η₁ + ξ", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.solve.struct"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-096", "subject": "math1", "stem": "向量组 α₁ = (1, 0, 1)，α₂ = (0, 1, 1)，α₃ = (1, 1, 1) 满足：\nA. 线性无关\nB. 线性相关\nC. 其中仅有两个向量线性无关\nD. 相关性无法确定", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.independence"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-097", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 α₁、α₂、α₃ 线性无关，则下列向量组中线性无关的是：\nA. α₁+α₂，α₂+α₃，α₃-α₁\nB. α₁+α₂，α₂+α₃，α₃+α₁\nC. α₁-α₂，α₂-α₃，α₁-α₃\nD. α₁+α₂，α₂+α₃，α₁+2α₂+α₃", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.independence"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-098", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设向量组 (I)：α₁, …, αₛ 能由向量组 (II)：β₁, …, βₜ 线性表示，则：\nA. 若 s > t，则 (II) 线性相关\nB. 若 s < t，则 (I) 线性相关\nC. 若 s = t，则 (I) 与 (II) 等价\nD. 若 s > t，则 (I) 线性相关", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.independence"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-099", "subject": "math1", "stem": "向量 β = (1, 1, 1) 在基 α₁ = (1, 0, 1)，α₂ = (1, 1, 0)，α₃ = (0, 1, 1) 下的坐标为：\nA. (1, 1, 1)\nB. (1/3, 1/3, 1/3)\nC. (1/2, 1/2, 1/2)\nD. (1/2, 1/3, 1/6)", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.basis"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-100", "subject": "math1", "stem": "由基 ε₁ = (1, 0)^T，ε₂ = (0, 1)^T 到基 α₁ = (1, 1)^T，α₂ = (1, -1)^T 的过渡矩阵为：\nA. [[1, 0], [0, 1]]\nB. [[1, 1], [1, -1]]\nC. [[1, 1], [-1, 1]]\nD. [[1, -1], [1, 1]]", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.basis"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-101", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 n 阶正交矩阵，则下列结论中不一定成立的是：\nA. A^T·A = E\nB. |A| = 1\nC. A 可逆且 A^(-1) = A^T\nD. |A| = ±1", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.orthogonal"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-102", "subject": "math1", "stem": "用施密特正交化方法将向量组 α₁ = (1, 1, 0)，α₂ = (1, 0, 1) 正交化，取 β₁ = α₁，则 β₂ =\nA. (1/2, -1/2, 1)\nB. (1, -1, 1)\nC. (1/2, 1/2, 1)\nD. (-1/2, 1/2, 1)", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.orthogonal"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-103", "subject": "math1", "stem": "矩阵 A 的两行依次为 (1, 2)、(2, 1)，则 A 的特征值为：\nA. 1 和 3\nB. -1 和 1\nC. 2 和 -3\nD. 3 和 -1", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.eigen"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-104", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 n 阶矩阵 A 满足 A^2 = A，则 A 的特征值只能是：\nA. ±1\nB. 0\nC. 0 或 1\nD. 任意实数", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.eigen"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-105", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 3 阶矩阵 A 的特征值为 1、2、3，则 |A^2 + E| =\nA. 100\nB. 50\nC. 120\nD. 36", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.eigen"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-106", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 A 为 3 阶可逆矩阵，λ 是 A 的特征值，则伴随矩阵 A* 必有特征值：\nA. λ/|A|\nB. |A|·λ\nC. |A|/λ\nD. λ", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.eigen"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-107", "subject": "math1", "stem": "下列 2 阶矩阵中不能相似于对角矩阵的是：\nA. 两行依次为 (1, 0)、(0, 2) 的矩阵\nB. 两行依次为 (1, 1)、(0, 1) 的矩阵\nC. 两行依次为 (0, 1)、(1, 0) 的矩阵\nD. 两行依次为 (2, 0)、(0, 3) 的矩阵", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.diagonal"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-108", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设矩阵 A 与 B 相似，则下列结论中不一定成立的是：\nA. |A| = |B|\nB. A 与 B 有相同的特征值\nC. tr(A) = tr(B)\nD. A 与 B 有相同的特征向量", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.diagonal"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-109", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设矩阵 A 的两行依次为 (3, -2)、(1, 0)，可逆矩阵 P 使得 P^(-1)AP = [[1, 0], [0, 2]]（第一行 (1, 0)，第二行 (0, 2)），则 P 可取为：\nA. 两行依次为 (1, 2)、(1, 1) 的矩阵\nB. 两行依次为 (2, 1)、(1, 1) 的矩阵\nC. 两行依次为 (1, 1)、(1, 2) 的矩阵\nD. 两行依次为 (1, 2)、(2, 1) 的矩阵", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.diagonal", "math.linalg.eigen"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-110", "subject": "math1", "stem": "二次型 f(x₁, x₂, x₃) = x₁² + 2x₂² + 3x₃² + 2x₁x₂ + 2x₂x₃ 的矩阵为：\nA. 三行依次为 (1, 2, 0)、(2, 2, 2)、(0, 2, 3)\nB. 三行依次为 (1, 1, 0)、(1, 2, 1)、(0, 1, 3)\nC. 三行依次为 (1, 1, 1)、(1, 2, 1)、(1, 1, 3)\nD. 三行依次为 (1, 0, 1)、(0, 2, 0)、(1, 0, 3)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.quadratic"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-111", "subject": "math1", "stem": "用正交变换将二次型 f(x₁, x₂) = 2x₁² + 2x₁x₂ + 2x₂² 化为标准形，则该标准形为：\nA. 2y₁² + 4y₂²\nB. y₁² + 2y₂²\nC. y₁² + 3y₂²\nD. 4y₁² + 2y₂²", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.quadratic"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-112", "subject": "math1", "stem": "二次型 f(x₁, x₂) = x₁² + 2x₁x₂ + x₂² 的秩与正惯性指数分别为：\nA. 秩为 1，正惯性指数为 1\nB. 秩为 2，正惯性指数为 1\nC. 秩为 1，正惯性指数为 2\nD. 秩为 2，正惯性指数为 2", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.linalg.quadratic"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-113", "subject": "math1", "stem": "二次型 f = 2x₁² + 3x₂² + 3x₃² + 2x₂x₃ 是：\nA. 负定二次型\nB. 不定二次型\nC. 半正定二次型\nD. 正定二次型", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.linalg.positive"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-114", "subject": "math1", "stem": "二次型 f(x₁, x₂, x₃) = x₁² + 2x₂² + t·x₃² + 2x₁x₂ + 2x₂x₃ 正定的充要条件是：\nA. t ≥ 1\nB. t > 1\nC. t > 0\nD. t < 1", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.linalg.positive"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-115", "subject": "math1", "stem": "n 阶实对称矩阵 A 正定的充分必要条件是：\nA. |A| > 0\nB. A 的所有元素全为正数\nC. A 的特征值全为正数\nD. r(A) = n", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.linalg.positive"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-116", "subject": "math1", "stem": "掷两枚均匀骰子，点数之和等于 7 的概率为：\nA. 7/36\nB. 1/9\nC. 5/36\nD. 1/6", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.events"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-117", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 P(A) = 0.4，P(B) = 0.5，P(AB) = 0.2，则 P(A∪B) =\nA. 0.7\nB. 0.9\nC. 0.3\nD. 0.2", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.events"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-118", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 P(A) = 0.5，P(B) = 0.4，且 A 与 B 互不相容，则 P(Ā∪B̄) =\nA. 0.9\nB. 0.1\nC. 1\nD. 0.5", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.events"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-119", "subject": "math1", "stem": "某工厂甲、乙两条生产线的产量分别占全厂的 60% 和 40%，次品率分别为 1% 和 2%。从全厂产品中任取一件，它是次品的概率为：\nA. 0.015\nB. 0.014\nC. 0.012\nD. 0.02", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.cond"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-120", "subject": "math1", "stem": "一号盒装 2 个红球 1 个白球，二号盒装 1 个红球 2 个白球。随机取一个盒子，再从中任取一球，结果取到红球，则该球来自一号盒的概率为：\nA. 1/3\nB. 1/2\nC. 3/4\nD. 2/3", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.cond"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-121", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 P(A) = 1/2，P(B) = 1/2，P(B|A) = 1/3，则 P(A|B) =\nA. 1/3\nB. 1/2\nC. 1/6\nD. 2/3", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.cond"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-122", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设事件 A 与 B 相互独立，P(A) = 0.4，P(B) = 0.5，则 P(A∪B) =\nA. 0.9\nB. 0.7\nC. 0.6\nD. 0.8", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.indep"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-123", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设事件 A 与 B 相互独立，则下列各对事件中不一定相互独立的是：\nA. Ā 与 B̄\nB. A 与 B̄\nC. Ā 与 B\nD. Ā 与 A∪B", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.indep"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-124", "subject": "math1", "stem": "下列函数中可以作为随机变量 X 的分布函数的是：\nA. F(x) = e^(-x^2)（-∞ < x < +∞）\nB. F(x) = 1/(1 + x^2)（-∞ < x < +∞）\nC. F(x) = 0（x < 0），x（0 ≤ x < 1），1（x ≥ 1）\nD. F(x) = sin x（-∞ < x < +∞）", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.rv"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-125", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设随机变量 X 的分布函数 F(x) 在 x = a 处连续，则 P(X = a) =\nA. F(a)\nB. 0\nC. 1 - F(a)\nD. 不能确定", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.rv"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-126", "subject": "math1", "stem": "掷一枚均匀硬币 4 次，恰好出现 2 次正面的概率为：\nA. 1/4\nB. 3/8\nC. 1/2\nD. 1/8", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.discrete"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-127", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设离散型随机变量 X 的分布律为 P(X = k) = c·(1/2)^k（k = 0, 1, 2），则常数 c =\nA. 4/7\nB. 2/7\nC. 1/7\nD. 7/4", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.discrete"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-128", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X ~ B(10, 0.4)，则 E(X) 与 D(X) 分别为：\nA. 4 和 6\nB. 4 和 0.24\nC. 0.4 和 0.24\nD. 4 和 2.4", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.discrete"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-129", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X 在区间 (0, 2) 上服从均匀分布，则 P(X > 1.5) =\nA. 0.5\nB. 0.75\nC. 0.25\nD. 0.125", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.cont"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-130", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X ~ N(1, 4)，则 P(X ≤ 1) =\nA. 0.5\nB. 0.9772\nC. 0.8413\nD. 0.3413", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.cont"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-131", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设连续型随机变量 X 的概率密度为 f(x) = k·e^(-2x)（x > 0），f(x) = 0（x ≤ 0），则常数 k 与 P(X > 1) 分别为：\nA. k = 1/2，P(X > 1) = e^(-2)\nB. k = 2，P(X > 1) = 1 - e^(-2)\nC. k = 2，P(X > 1) = e^(-2)\nD. k = 1，P(X > 1) = e^(-1)", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.cont"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-132", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X ~ U(0, 1)，则 Y = 2X + 1 服从：\nA. U(0, 2)\nB. U(1, 3)\nC. U(1, 2)\nD. U(2, 3)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.rv.func"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-133", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X ~ N(0, 1)，则 Y = X^2 服从：\nA. N(0, 1)\nB. 参数为 1 的指数分布\nC. 区间 (0, 1) 上的均匀分布\nD. 自由度为 1 的卡方分布 χ²(1)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.rv.func"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-134", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X 的分布律为 P(X = -1) = 1/4，P(X = 0) = 1/2，P(X = 1) = 1/4，则 E(X^2) =\nA. 1/2\nB. 0\nC. 1/4\nD. 1", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.expectation"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-135", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X 服从参数为 2 的指数分布，则 E(X) =\nA. 2\nB. 1/2\nC. 1\nD. 1/4", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.expectation"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-136", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X ~ U(-1, 2)，则 E(X^2) =\nA. 1/3\nB. 1/2\nC. 1\nD. 4/3", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.expectation"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-137", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 E(X) = 1，E(X^2) = 5，则 D(X) =\nA. 4\nB. 5\nC. 6\nD. 1", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.variance"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-138", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 D(X) = 2，则 D(2X - 1) =\nA. 4\nB. 3\nC. 2\nD. 8", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.variance"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-139", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 E(X) = 1，E(Y) = 2，E(XY) = 3，则 Cov(X, Y) =\nA. 3\nB. 1\nC. -1\nD. 5", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.cov"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-140", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X 与 Y 相互独立，D(X) = 4，D(Y) = 9，则 D(3X - 2Y) =\nA. 0\nB. 36\nC. 72\nD. 18", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.cov"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-141", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设随机变量 X 的方差 D(X) = 4，则由切比雪夫不等式可得 P(|X - E(X)| ≥ 6) ≤\nA. 1/4\nB. 4/9\nC. 1/36\nD. 1/9", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.chebyshev"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-142", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X₁, …, Xₙ 独立同分布，E(Xᵢ) = μ，D(Xᵢ) = σ² < ∞，则由大数定律，(X₁ + … + Xₙ)/n 依概率收敛于：\nA. μ\nB. σ²\nC. μ/n\nD. nμ", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.chebyshev"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-143", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X₁, …, X₁₀₀ 独立同分布，E(Xᵢ) = 2，D(Xᵢ) = 4，则由中心极限定理，X₁ + … + X₁₀₀ 近似服从：\nA. N(200, 4)\nB. N(2, 4)\nC. N(200, 400)\nD. N(20, 40)", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.clt"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-144", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X ~ B(100, 0.5)，由中心极限定理，P(45 ≤ X ≤ 55) ≈（已知 Φ(1) = 0.8413）\nA. 0.8413\nB. 0.6826\nC. 0.9544\nD. 0.5", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.clt"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-145", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X₁, …, Xₙ 是来自正态总体 N(μ, σ²) 的样本，S² 为样本方差，则 (n-1)S²/σ² 服从：\nA. χ²(n)\nB. t(n-1)\nC. F(n-1, n)\nD. χ²(n-1)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.sample"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-146", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X₁, …, X₁₆ 是来自 N(0, 4) 的样本，X̄ 为样本均值，则 2X̄ 服从：\nA. N(0, 1)\nB. N(0, 4)\nC. N(0, 1/4)\nD. t(15)", "answer": "A", "concepts": ["math.prob.sample"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-147", "subject": "math1", "stem": "对总体均值 μ 作矩估计时，μ 的矩估计量为：\nA. 样本方差 S²\nB. 样本均值 X̄\nC. 样本中位数\nD. max(X₁, …, Xₙ)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.estimate"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-148", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设 X₁, …, Xₙ 是来自均匀总体 U(0, θ) 的样本，则 θ 的最大似然估计量为：\nA. 样本均值 X̄\nB. 2X̄\nC. min(X₁, …, Xₙ)\nD. max(X₁, …, Xₙ)", "answer": "D", "concepts": ["math.prob.estimate"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-149", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设正态总体的方差 σ² 已知，则均值 μ 的置信度 1-α 的置信区间为：\nA. X̄ ± t_{α/2}(n-1)·S/√n\nB. X̄ ± z_α·σ/√n\nC. X̄ ± z_{α/2}·σ/√n\nD. X̄ ± z_{α/2}·σ²/n", "answer": "C", "concepts": ["math.prob.interval"], "source": "self-built"}
{"id": "qmath1-150", "subject": "math1", "stem": "设总体 X ~ N(μ, σ²)，σ = 2 已知，取样本量 n = 16，样本均值 X̄ = 10，则 μ 的置信度 0.95 的置信区间为（z_{0.025} = 1.96）：\nA. (9.51, 10.49)\nB. (9.02, 10.98)\nC. (9.6, 10.4)\nD. (8.04, 11.96)", "answer": "B", "concepts": ["math.prob.interval"], "source": "self-built"}
